# Prompt changes

1. Default prompt **files** live under `src/infrastructure/ai/prompts/` (loaded by `resolveAdminSettings`).
2. Bump **`PROMPT_BUNDLE_VERSION`** in `src/domain/types.ts` when defaults change so stale admin DB overrides refresh.
3. Admin-edited prompts stored in `admin_settings` with matching `prompt_bundle_version`.
4. Extraction schemas: `src/infrastructure/ai/schemas.ts` — keep Zod patches aligned with prompts.
5. Live CV tests (optional): `npm run test:cv-live` — requires API key; not CI-default.

After prompt changes, smoke-test one employee and one employer chat turn locally.
